      <section id="why" class="lt wide">
        <div class="intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Why a game</p>
          <h2>Affiliates scroll past one more sale banner.</h2>
          <p>EarnKaro’s users are affiliates. They share deals with their network and earn profit on every sale, and they see a new sale banner almost every week. A birthday sale needed a reason to open the page, and a reason to come back.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="goals g3 vis">
          <div><span class="k">Who it is for</span><p>EarnKaro affiliates who share deals and earn profit on every sale they drive.</p></div>
          <div><span class="k">The ask</span><p>A campaign for EarnKaro’s 7th birthday, live from 3 to 10 July.</p></div>
          <div><span class="k">The rule</span><p>One jackpot, one exclusive deal a day. Win today, come back tomorrow.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="landing" class="lt wide">
        <div class="intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">The landing page</p>
          <h2>One page, built around one game</h2>
          <p>A birthday hero with the dates up front, the 777 Jackpot inside the first scroll, and hourly loot deals below, so the page stays useful after the daily spin.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp vis">
          <figure><img src="img/02-landing-desktop.webp" width="1600" height="2289" alt="Desktop landing page: EarnKaro Big Birthday Bash hero with the 3rd to 10th July dates, the 777 Jackpot slot machine beside EarnKaro Turns 7! Let’s Make It a Big Birthday Bash, and Hourly Loot Deals Are Live from Flipkart, Myntra and AJIO below" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Desktop</figcaption></figure>
          <figure><img src="img/02-landing-mobile.webp" width="760" height="2346" alt="Mobile landing page: the birthday hero, the dates, the 777 Jackpot slot machine and the loot deals below it" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Mobile web and app</figcaption></figure>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="game" class="wide">
        <div class="intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">The game</p>
          <h2>Hit 777, unlock today’s deal</h2>
          <p>A plain sale gets one visit. Capping the win at one a day gave the page eight. Every visit ends with a reason to come back tomorrow.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps vis">
          <li><div class="tile machine"><img src="img/03-spin.webp" width="600" height="520" alt="The 777 Jackpot slot machine with empty reels" loading="lazy"></div><span class="n">01</span><h3>Spin</h3><p>Pull the lever and the reels roll.</p></li>
          <li><div class="tile machine"><img src="img/03-hit.webp" width="600" height="520" alt="The slot machine showing 7, 7, 7" loading="lazy"></div><span class="n">02</span><h3>Hit 777</h3><p>Three sevens light the machine up.</p></li>
          <li><div class="tile card"><img src="img/03-claim.webp" width="566" height="802" alt="Deal card: Sanfe Instant Tan and Dead Skin Removal Gel, 399 struck through, 180, Flat 10% profit" loading="lazy"></div><span class="n">03</span><h3>Claim the deal</h3><p>Brand, price and the profit for sharing it.</p></li>
          <li><div class="tile card"><img src="img/03-locked.webp" width="567" height="802" alt="Locked card: You’ve Already Won Today, Come back tomorrow and win again, Today’s Reward, the Sanfe deal" loading="lazy"></div><span class="n">04</span><h3>Come back tomorrow</h3><p>Already won today. A new brand drops tomorrow.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section id="deal" class="lt wide">
        <div class="intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Deal card</p>
          <h2>Every deal shows what you earn</h2>
          <p>Affiliates care about what they earn, not what the buyer saves. So every card leads with profit, and keeps the same anatomy for a tan gel, a smartwatch or a speaker.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="deal vis">
          <figure class="anat">
            <ul>
              <li style="--y:3.5%">Brand</li>
              <li style="--y:32.8%">Product</li>
              <li style="--y:76%">Price hook</li>
              <li style="--y:88.4%">Profit you earn</li>
