      <section id="cards" class="lt wide">
        <div class="intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Card system</p>
          <h2>Eight days, eight brands, one card</h2>
          <p>One reward a day from 3 to 10 July. The brand chip, product, price and profit always sit in the same place, so the eye knows where to look on day eight.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="days vis">
          <li><span class="d"><b>DAY 1</b>3 July</span><img src="img/05-day1.webp" width="562" height="797" alt="Day 1, Sanfe: Instant Tan and Dead Skin Removal Gel, 399 struck through, 180, Flat 10% profit" loading="lazy"></li>
          <li><span class="d"><b>DAY 2</b>4 July</span><img src="img/05-day2.webp" width="562" height="797" alt="Day 2, mCaffeine: Buy 2 Get 3 on mCaffeine, Flat 16% profit" loading="lazy"></li>
